WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.599 --> 00:00:03.139
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:03.139 --> 00:00:08.640
Today I am going to explain a Sci-Fi thriller
film called “Blindness.”

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:09.840
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:15.920
Watch out and take care!

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:21.220
The movie begins with the scene of a young
man on his way to work suddenly going blind

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:23.140
in the middle of a traffic stop.

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:27.330
When the traffic light turns green and the
man is not able to move his car, the cars

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:30.380
behind him begin honking at him repeatedly.

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:34.899
Soon some concerned city dwellers approach
the man and learn that he has lost his vision.

00:00:34.899 --> 00:00:40.239
A good samaritan named X offers to drive the
man home and help clear the traffic.

00:00:40.239 --> 00:00:44.749
As they head to his apartment, the blind man
describes his sudden affliction as an expanse

00:00:44.749 --> 00:00:48.569
of dazzling white as though he is “swimming
in milk”.

00:00:48.569 --> 00:00:51.789
Eventually they arrive at the blind man’s
upscale apartment.

00:00:51.789 --> 00:00:56.549
However, as soon as the blind man gets out
of his car, the rescuer flees with the blind

00:00:56.549 --> 00:00:57.549
man’s vehicle.

00:00:57.549 --> 00:01:01.530
Later, the blind man’s wife returns home
and is shocked to learn about her husband’s

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:02.530
condition.

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:05.549
She immediately decides to take him to a local
ophthalmologist.

00:01:05.549 --> 00:01:09.990
The doctor performs a thorough examination
of the man’s eyes but fails to find the

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:15.630
reason for his sudden blindness.

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:20.409
For most blind people everything goes dark
but the blind man mentions seeing white.

00:01:20.409 --> 00:01:22.729
The doctor refers the man to a hospital.

00:01:22.729 --> 00:01:27.250
Meanwhile, the man who stole the blind man’s
car runs into a police check.

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:31.439
Afraid of getting caught, he illegally changes
lanes and abandons the car.

00:01:31.439 --> 00:01:36.799
However, before he could get away, the man
gets his karma and suddenly goes blind like

00:01:36.799 --> 00:01:38.630
the man who he stole from.

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:42.270
At home, the doctor tells his wife about the
strange illness.

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:46.049
After eating the dinner that she makes for
him, the doctor stays up late to research

00:01:46.049 --> 00:01:47.290
the condition.

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:51.659
By the next morning, two more people become
victims of the illness, a local prostitute

00:01:51.659 --> 00:01:55.189
who always wears dark glasses and the doctor
himself.

00:01:55.189 --> 00:01:59.909
The doctor’s wife tries to examine his eyes
but he pushes her away, afraid of infecting

00:01:59.909 --> 00:02:01.259
her with the condition.

00:02:01.259 --> 00:02:05.869
However, she refuses his attempts to keep
her at arm's length and promises she will

00:02:05.869 --> 00:02:06.909
be safe.

00:02:06.909 --> 00:02:11.810
In various locations of the city, several
more citizens are struck blind, causing widespread

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:12.810
panic.

00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:17.190
The government takes cognizance of the situation
and prepares a quarantine facility in a local

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:18.690
derelict asylum.

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:23.510
A crew wearing hazmat suits arrives outside
the doctor’s home to pick him up.

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:27.960
Worried about him, the doctor’s wife climbs
into the van with him pretending to be blind

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:30.090
to accompany him into isolation.

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:35.420
The facility has been divided into multiple
wards and each ward must elect a ward captain

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:38.750
to represent them and communicate with the
outside world.

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:43.810
The woman who wears dark glasses, the first
blind man, the car thief, and a young boy

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:46.120
join the doctor in his ward.

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:50.210
The first blind man quickly recognizes the
car thief’s voice and a fight breaks out

00:02:50.210 --> 00:02:53.730
between the two.

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:58.150
The doctor breaks them apart and effectively
assumes the role of the ward’s captain.

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:07.940
The doctor’s wife teaches the blind how
to navigate in the corridors.

00:03:07.940 --> 00:03:12.420
More blind people join the doctor’s ward
including the first blind man’s wife.

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:16.581
With the number of infected people rapidly
increasing, in a due course of time, more

00:03:16.581 --> 00:03:21.480
and more people are crammed into the same
facility, way beyond its capacity.

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:26.340
The overcrowding and neglect from the government
causes the hygiene and living conditions in

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:29.070
the facility to deteriorate rapidly.

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:33.300
The walls and the floors soon become caked
in filth and feces.

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:35.150
People become increasingly hopeless.

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:40.370
Anxiety over the availability of food, caused
by irregular deliveries, undermines the infected

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:41.590
people’s morale.

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:46.460
The soldiers who guard the asylum become increasingly
hostile and the government refuses to allow

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:50.660
in basic medicines, so that a simple infection
becomes deadly.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:55.090
One day, the doctor’s wife meets an old
man with an eye-patch in the facility.

00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:58.530
He lives in another ward but asks to move
to the doctor’s ward.

00:03:58.530 --> 00:04:02.780
The old man has a radio so the doctor’s
wife allows him to change wards.

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:06.830
The old man tells the doctor and others in
his ward about the things he knows about the

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:08.720
outside world through the radio.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:12.830
He tells them that the sudden blindness which
is known as the white sickness has spread

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:16.910
all around the world, with hundreds of cases
being reported everyday.

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:21.650
The governments around the world held countless
seminars and round table talks on the situation

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:23.970
but couldn’t find a solution.

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:28.380
Things quickly went out of control and the
outside world has come to a halt.

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:33.100
One day, while delivering a new batch of infected
people to the facility, a blind man wanders

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:36.840
away from his group and gets mercilessly shot
by the soldiers.

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:40.560
Panic ensues and two other people get killed
in the resulting stampede.

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:45.410
The next day, the soldiers callously toss
a shovel over the wall that surrounds the

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:50.290
quarantine facility and order the infected
people to bury the corpses of the people killed

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:51.310
the other day.

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:55.440
The doctor proposes that they divide the work
and each ward buries one body.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:05:00.130
People of ward 3 are not pleased with the
idea and they refuse to take responsibility

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:01.820
for people they don’t even know.

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:07.120
The doctor clashes with their leader who declares
himself as the king of ward 3.

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:11.520
Over the course of the next few days, the
thief, who is no longer able to walk because

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:15.210
of an infection, finds out the truth about
the doctor’s wife.

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:19.380
He confronts her about it and pleads with
her to help him escape so he could get his

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:20.660
infection treated.

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:24.960
However, the doctor’s wife dismisses him
and tells him that he is wrong about her.

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:31.330
Fed up of waiting for treatment, the thief
attempts to flee the facility that night but

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:32.920
ends up getting shot dead.

00:05:32.920 --> 00:05:36.889
The doctor’s wife feels she is responsible
for the thief’s death but the doctor tells

00:05:36.889 --> 00:05:39.530
her that she is already doing everything she
can.

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:43.420
When she continues to insist that she should
have come clean about her eyesight, the doctor

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:47.200
gets upset with her and tells her that she
is already acting like everyone’s “mother”

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:49.230
and she doesn’t need to do more.

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:53.920
The king of ward 3 and his men hold everyone
at gunpoint and take control over the food

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:55.590
that the government delivers.

00:05:55.590 --> 00:06:00.270
He orders everyone to hand over their valuable
possessions to him in exchange for rations.

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:04.330
The infected reluctantly relinquish their
valuables with which they had sentimental

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:09.060
values attached in exchange for food which
is way less than they used to get before.

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:14.260
Moreover, due to frustration of being unable
to take care of himself and a feeling of helplessness,

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:17.139
the doctor and his wife continue to drift
apart.

00:06:17.139 --> 00:06:21.310
After finding the doctor upset, the woman
with the dark glasses comforts him and tries

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:22.620
to cheer him up.

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:26.590
One thing leads to another and the doctor
and the woman end have having sex.

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:31.050
Both immediately regret it even more so when
they realise that the doctor’s wife witnessed

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:32.669
their entire tryst.

00:06:32.669 --> 00:06:36.590
The woman apologises to his wife and learns
about her eyesight.

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:41.370
The next day, the King of Ward 3 demands women
in exchange for food.

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:44.520
People refuse to comply and three days pass
by.

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:48.490
The doctor’s wife asks the soldiers outside
for food but they tell her that they have

00:06:48.490 --> 00:06:53.080
already received food for the week and the
responsibility of distribution is solely on

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:54.620
the people inside.

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:59.160
Desperate for food, people begin debating
whether they should comply with the ward 3’s

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:00.160
demands.

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:01.580
They ask the doctor for advice.

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:05.650
He tells them that he is in no place to guide
them and asks them to do whatever they feel

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:06.710
like doing.

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:09.461
One by one, the women volunteer to be sex
slaves for the men in the ward 3, and the

00:07:09.461 --> 00:07:10.461
King of Ward 3 forces himself on the doctor's
wife.

00:07:10.461 --> 00:07:11.461
One of the women is brutally beaten to death
by her tormentor.

00:07:11.461 --> 00:07:13.710
The next day, the ward 3 men take the women
of ward 2.

00:07:13.710 --> 00:07:18.930
A ward 3 man taunts the doctor’s wife on
his way back, which makes her snap.

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:22.790
She takes a scissor to ward 3 and murders
their leader.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:27.180
She proudly boasts to the ward 3 men that
they will never be able to know who she is

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:29.380
before walking away with the women.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:32.730
She tells her husband about the revenge but
he could care less about it.

00:07:32.730 --> 00:07:35.040
He is more worried about the possible war.

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:39.870
The people of ward 1 and 2 learn about the
assasinationg of the king of ward 3 and grow

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:42.010
worried about a retaliation.

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:45.650
Meanwhile, they barricade their wall anticipating
a possible war.

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:49.669
The group then discusses giving up the person
who killed the leader of ward 3.

00:07:49.669 --> 00:07:54.400
Hearing this, the doctor’s wife almost gives
herself up but she is interrupted by the radio

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:57.800
man, who suggests that they should get the
food back themselves.

00:07:57.800 --> 00:08:01.330
In this way, the group plots a plan to fight
back.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:05.840
One of the girls from ward 1 sneaks into ward
3 and lights a chair on fire.

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:09.669
This gives ward one the opportunity to approach
ward 3 with weapons.

00:08:09.669 --> 00:08:14.320
However, the fire has spread to all wards,
and chaos ensues.

00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:18.320
Everyone goes outside and the doctor’s wife
calls out to the guards but finds out that

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:19.680
no one is there.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:24.620
She then finds out that the doors are unlocked
and everyone finally leaves the place.

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:29.190
As they walk around the city, they notice
how far society has fallen and witness the

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:31.350
devastation around them.

00:08:31.350 --> 00:08:34.409
Blind people roam the streets and everything
looks grim.

00:08:34.409 --> 00:08:38.089
Eventually, the doctor and his wife head out
to salvage supplies.

00:08:38.089 --> 00:08:42.289
The doctor tries telling his wife that he
misses her but she remains cold and ignores

00:08:42.289 --> 00:08:43.469
his sentiments.

00:08:43.469 --> 00:08:47.740
The wife then enters a supermarket but finds
that all the racks are empty and people are

00:08:47.740 --> 00:08:49.699
going paranoid with hunger.

00:08:49.699 --> 00:08:53.529
She then ventures to the basement and finds
a large stack of food that she hadn't even

00:08:53.529 --> 00:08:55.369
dreamt of since ages.

00:08:55.369 --> 00:08:58.290
She collects 2 bags of supplies and goes upstairs.

00:08:58.290 --> 00:09:02.889
However, the hunger stricken people sense
that she has something and immediately attack

00:09:02.889 --> 00:09:03.889
her.

00:09:03.889 --> 00:09:08.149
The doctor who was waiting at the door, rushes
to aid her and the couple run away.

00:09:08.149 --> 00:09:12.130
After they reach a safe place, the doctor
realizes that he left his clothes behind at

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:15.050
the supermarket so he returns to get them
back.

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:19.490
The tired wife sits and looks on as a pack
of dogs eat a dead man.

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:22.509
Suddenly, a dog comes by and gives her company.

00:09:22.509 --> 00:09:26.420
It starts raining so she gets inside and the
dog follows her.

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:31.040
The doctor also arrives with the clothes and
after wearing jackets, they head back to their

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:32.040
place.

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:36.050
Outside, the people enjoy the rain and are
seen rejoicing in the experience, even if

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:37.769
it's for a little while.

00:09:37.769 --> 00:09:41.019
The following day, the doctor’s wife takes
the group to their home.

00:09:41.019 --> 00:09:44.769
Fortunately, no one had invaded their home
and it looks intact.

00:09:44.769 --> 00:09:48.899
She then cleans up the messy place in order
to make everyone feel at home.

00:09:48.899 --> 00:09:53.000
There, everyone is seen helping each other
as if they are one big family.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:57.610
The 3 women later take a shower where they
are laughing and enjoying the experience.

00:09:57.610 --> 00:10:01.829
The doctor’s wife describes the women to
them as they haven’t seen themselves in

00:10:01.829 --> 00:10:03.040
a long while.

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:06.949
Later that night, the radio man expresses
his happiness on the fact that he has met

00:10:06.949 --> 00:10:09.699
a lot of good people during these critical
times.

00:10:09.699 --> 00:10:14.199
He also continues by saying that they can
live together like this for a long time.

00:10:14.199 --> 00:10:18.309
During dinner, the doctor’s wife cheerfully
describes the items and their locations on

00:10:18.309 --> 00:10:22.249
the table and the group has an awkward cheers,
which they laugh at.

00:10:22.249 --> 00:10:26.890
That night, the doctor and his wife finally
make love and he explains how much he loves

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:27.890
her.

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:31.339
The following morning, the doctor’s wife
wakes up early and makes her special coffee

00:10:31.339 --> 00:10:32.579
for everyone.

00:10:32.579 --> 00:10:36.540
Suddenly, the first man starts seeing everything
around him.

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:41.259
Mixed with feelings of shock and joy, he exclaims
that everything is very beautiful.

00:10:41.259 --> 00:10:44.990
He then goes around the house, greeting everyone
with happiness.

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:49.180
Everyone is extremely happy at the new revelation,
thinking that it's only a matter of time before

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:51.350
their sight is back as well.

